			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"text": "Emotions heightened\n\nAs our awareness of the \nnegative heightened emotional \nresponses intensify. Fear and \nanger dominate.",
			"rawText": "Emotions heightened\n\nAs our awareness of the negative heightened emotional responses intensify. Fear and anger dominate.",
