			"updated": 1675185308355,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"text": "Heart rate increases\nEpinephrine increases heart \nrate so more blood can pump\nthrough body, ready for \naction. \n  Increased heart rate \nallows stress hormones to \nflood through the blood \nstream. Body prepares to \nfight or flee.  ",
			"rawText": "Heart rate increases\nEpinephrine increases heart rate so more blood can pump through body, ready for action. \n    \n   \n  Increased heart rate allows stress hormones to flood through the blood stream. Body prepares to fight or flee.  ",
			"baseline": 243,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "iPKWujXcLorGf14e_oDsr",
			"originalText": "Heart rate increases\nEpinephrine increases heart rate so more blood can pump through body, ready for action. \n    \n   \n  Increased heart rate allows stress hormones to flood through the blood stream. Body prepares to fight or flee.  "
		},
